s Special Cooldown of this character by 2 turns after each turn you take damage and deals 10% of enemies'' current HP in True damage, ignoring Normal Attack Only, to all enemies at the start of every stage. If a crew member uses a special with a Percent Damage Reduction, Threshold Damage Reduction or Damage Nullification buff, replaces those buffs with an ATK boost that will overwrite ATK boosts in the same special: Boosts ATK of Driven and Powerhouse characters by 2x for 1 turn."}],"captainNotes":null,"specialName":"Tremendous Dismay of Darkness and Earthquakes","specialText":"Adds 1.0x to Chain multiplier for 1 turn and becomes Blackbeard, Two Overwhelming Abilities for 3-8 turns depending on the total Damage Taken before the special is activated. If your Captain is a Powerhouse or Driven character, increases duration of any ATK boosting buffs and Orb Amplification buffs by 1 turn.","specialNotes":"0 damage: 3 turns. ? damage: 4 turns. ? damage: 5 turns. ? damage: 6 turns. ? damage: 7 turns. 50,000 damage: 8 turns","superSpecialText":null,"superSpecialCriteriaText":null,"superSpecialNotes":null,"superSpecialCriteria":null,"partyConflictKeys":["marshall d. teach","teach"],"characterTags":[],"builderAbilities":[{"key":"extend_turn_duration","label":"Extend Turn Duration","minTurns":null,"isCompleteRemoval":false,"slotTokens":[],"source":"specialText","coverageMode":"explicit"},{"key":"reduce_damage","label":"Reduce Damage","minTurns":null,"isCompleteRemoval":false,"slotTokens":[],"source":"captainAbility","coverageMode":"explicit"},{"key":"reduce_special_charge","label":"Reduce Special Change","minTurns":null,"isCompleteRemoval":false,"slotTokens":[],"source":"captainAbility","coverageMode":"explicit"},{"key":"ignore_normal_attack_only","label":"Ignore Normal Attack Only (NAO)","minTurns":null,"isCompleteRemoval":false,"slotTokens":[],"source":"captainAbility","coverageMode":"explicit"},{"key":"special_damage","label":"Damage","minTurns":null,"isCompleteRemoval":fal