racters by 2.5x for 1 turn and boosts Orb Effects of Shooter and Cerebral characters by 2.5x for 1 turn. If your crew has Turn Progress Effect when the special is activated, changes all orbs, including [BLOCK] orbs, into [TND] orbs, locks all orbs for 2 turns and boosts Chain Multiplier Growth Rate by 1.2x for 3 turns.","specialNotes":null,"superSpecialText":"Increases boost effects of ATK UP and Orb Amplification buffs by +0.25x, Increases boost effects of ATK UP and Orb Amplification buffs applied by Shooter and Cerebral characters by 0.25x for 3 turns and transforms Cerebral characters into Super Cerebral characters.","superSpecialCriteriaText":"This character must be captain and your crew must consist of any 1 of the following, excluding Supports and counting only 1 per unit: Monkey D. Luffy, Shanks, Ben Beckman, Lucky Roux, Yasopp, Rockstar and Gordon.","superSpecialNotes":null,"superSpecialCriteria":{"rawText":"This character must be captain and your crew must consist of any 1 of the following, excluding Supports and counting only 1 per unit: Monkey D. Luffy, Shanks, Ben Beckman, Lucky Roux, Yasopp, Rockstar and Gordon.","requiresCaptain":true,"excludesSelf":false,"rosterBranches":[{"branchType":"character_count_any","requiredCount":1,"matchMode":"unique_options","options":[{"label":"Monkey D. Luffy","acceptedKeys":["monkey d luffy","luffy"]},{"label":"Shanks","acceptedKeys":["shanks"]},{"label":"Ben Beckman","acceptedKeys":["ben beckman","beckman"]},{"label":"Lucky Roux","acceptedKeys":["lucky roux","roux"]},{"label":"Yasopp","acceptedKeys":["yasopp"]},{"label":"Rockstar","acceptedKeys":["rockstar"]},{"label":"Gordon","acceptedKeys":["gordon"]}]}],"hasNonRosterBranches":false,"parserStatus":"roster_only"},"partyConflictKeys":["uta"],"characterTags":["Red-Haired Pirates","Paramythia-type"],"builderAbilities":[{"key":"boost_atk","label":"Boost ATK","minTurns":null,"isCompleteRemoval":false,"slotTokens":[],"source":"specialText","coverageMode":"explicit"},{"key"