ers by 1 turn at the start of the fight, boosts ATK of Slasher characters by 3x, boosts HP of Slasher characters by 1.2x and deals 0x-130x character''s ATK in Typeless damage to one enemy at the end of each turn depending on how many PERFECTs scored that turn."},{"key":"level5","label":"Limit Break Level 5 Captain Ability","text":"Reduces Special Cooldown of Slasher characters by 1 turn at the start of the fight, boosts ATK of Slasher characters by 3.5x, boosts HP of Slasher characters by 1.2x and deals 0x-140x character''s ATK in Typeless damage to one enemy at the end of each turn depending on how many PERFECTs scored that turn."},{"key":"level6","label":"Limit Break Level 6 Captain Ability","text":"Reduces Special Cooldown of Slasher characters by 1 turn at the start of the fight, boosts ATK of Slasher characters by 4x, boosts HP of Slasher characters by 1.25x and deals 0x-150x character''s ATK in Typeless damage to one enemy at the end of each turn depending on how many PERFECTs scored that turn."}],"captainNotes":null,"specialName":"Declaration of the Next Shogun","specialText":"Reduces Despair duration by 3 turns, changes the orb, including [BLOCK] orbs, of this character into a [WANO] orb and boosts Orb Effects of Slasher characters by 2.75x for 1 turn.","specialNotes":null,"superSpecialText":null,"superSpecialCriteriaText":null,"superSpecialNotes":null,"superSpecialCriteria":null,"partyConflictKeys":["kozuki momonosuke","momonosuke"],"characterTags":["Kozuki Clan","Land of Wano Arc"],"builderAbilities":[{"key":"remove_despair","label":"Remove Despair","minTurns":3,"isCompleteRemoval":false,"slotTokens":[],"source":"specialText","coverageMode":"explicit"},{"key":"boost_slot_effects","label":"Boost Slot Effects","minTurns":null,"isCompleteRemoval":false,"slotTokens":[],"source":"specialText","coverageMode":"explicit"},{"key":"change_slots","label":"Change Slots","minTurns":null,"isCompleteRemoval":false,"slotTokens":[],"source":"specialText","coverageMode":"explicit"},{"key":"change_block_slots","label":"Change [BLOCK] Slots","minTurns":null,"isCompleteRemoval":false,"slotTokens":[],"source":"specialText","coverageMode":"explicit"},{"key":"special_damage","label":"Damage","minTurns":null,"isCompleteRemoval":false,"slotTokens":[],"source":"captainAbility","coverageMode":"explicit"},{"key":"special_damage_other","label":"Other","minTurns":null,"isCompleteRemoval":false,"slotTokens":[],"source":"captainAbility","coverageMode":"explicit"},{"key":"reduce_special_charge","label":"Reduce Special Change","minTurns":null,"isCompleteRemoval":false,"slotTokens":[],"source":"captainAbility","coverageMode":"explicit"},{"key":"crewmate_make_slots_favorable","label":"Make Slots Favorable","minTurns":null,"isCompleteRemoval":false,"slotTokens":[],"source":"sailorAbilities","coverageMode":"explicit"},{"key":"potential_dex_damage_reduction","label":"DEX Damage Reduction","minTurns":null,"isCompleteRemoval":false,"slotTokens":[],"source":"potentialAbilities","coverageMode":"explicit"},{"key":"potential_pinch_healing","label":"Pinch Healing","minTurns":null,"isCompleteRemoval":false,"slotTokens":[],"source":"potentialAbilities","coverageMode":"explicit"},{"key":"potential_critical_atk","label":"Critical ATK","minTurns":null,"isCompleteRemoval":false,"slotTokens":[],"source":"potentialAbilities","coverageMode":"explicit"},{"key":"support_atk_boost","label":"ATK Boost","minTurns":null,"isCompleteRemoval":false,"slotTokens":[],"source":"supportData","coverageMode":"explicit"}],"sailorAbilities":["When any other Slasher character uses a special, reduces special cooldown of this character by 1 turn. Makes [STR] orbs beneficial for all characters"],"sailorNotes":null,"potentialAbilities":[{"Name":"[DEX] Damage Reduction","description":["Reduces damage taken from [DEX] characters by 5%"]},{"Name":"Pinch Healing","description":["If HP is below 50% at the start of the turn, recovers 1.5x this character''s RCV at the end of the turn for each time you