aracter, reduces enemies'' Driven and Cerebral Resistance by -20% for 1 turn."}],"captainNotes":null,"specialName":"Sand and Thread Pincer Attack","specialText":"Boosts ATK of Driven and Cerebral characters by 2.75x for 1 turn and becomes Doflamingo & Crocodile for 1 turn. Increases boost effects of 4 selected buffs depending on buffs selected. In exchange, reduces crew''s current HP by 25% crew''s MAX HP per selected buff. Buff Enhancements: Increases boost effects of ATK UP by +0.25x. Increases boost effects of Orb Amplification buffs by +0.25x. Increases boost effects of Color Affinity buffs by +0.25x. Increases boost effects of Status ATK buffs by +0.25x. Increases boost effects of Chain Lock buffs by +0.25x. Increases boost effects of Chain Addition buffs by +0.5x. Increases boost effects of Chain Multiplication buffs by +0.2x. Increases boost effects of Base ATK Boost buffs by +400.","specialNotes":"Requires exactly 25% MAX HP per selected buff, but if HP would be reduced to 0, 1 HP is left instead.","superSpecialText":null,"superSpecialCriteriaText":null,"superSpecialNotes":null,"superSpecialCriteria":null,"partyConflictKeys":["doflamingo & crocodile","doflamingo","crocodile"],"characterTags":[],"builderAbilities":[{"key":"boost_atk","label":"Boost ATK","minTurns":null,"isCompleteRemoval":false,"slotTokens":[],"source":"specialText","coverageMode":"explicit"},{"key":"boost_type_effects","label":"Boost Type Effects","minTurns":null,"isCompleteRemoval":false,"slotTokens":[],"source":"specialText","coverageMode":"explicit"},{"key":"boost_base_atk","label":"Boost Base ATK","minTurns":null,"isCompleteRemoval":false,"slotTokens":[],"source":"specialText","coverageMode":"explicit"},{"key":"effect_boost","label":"Effect Boost","minTurns":null,"isCompleteRemoval":false,"slotTokens":[],"source":"specialText","coverageMode":"explicit"},{"key":"make_slots_favorable","label":"Make Slots Favorable","minTurns":null,"isCompleteRemoval":false,"slotTokens":[],"source":"captain