 ATK Boost when the special is activated, adds 1.5x to Chain multiplier for 2 turns. If your crew has Chain Addition when the special is activated, boosts base ATK of all characters by 1250 for 2 turns.","specialNotes":null,"superSpecialText":"Deals 300x character''s ATK in [DEX] damage to all enemies at end of each turn for 3 turns, reduces the defense of all enemies by 90% for 3 turns, recovers 30% of crew''s MAX HP, allowing HP Overfill up to 2x MAX HP, and transforms [DEX] characters into Super [DEX] characters.","superSpecialCriteriaText":"This character must be captain and your crew must consist of any 1 of the following, excluding Supports and counting only 1 per unit: Charlotte Linlin (Big Mom), Charlotte Smoothie, Charlotte Cracker, Charlotte Perospero, Monkey D. Luffy, Shanks, Coby","superSpecialNotes":null,"superSpecialCriteria":{"rawText":"This character must be captain and your crew must consist of any 1 of the following, excluding Supports and counting only 1 per unit: Charlotte Linlin (Big Mom), Charlotte Smoothie, Charlotte Cracker, Charlotte Perospero, Monkey D. Luffy, Shanks, Coby","requiresCaptain":true,"excludesSelf":false,"rosterBranches":[{"branchType":"character_count_any","requiredCount":1,"matchMode":"unique_options","options":[{"label":"Charlotte Linlin (Big Mom)","acceptedKeys":["charlotte linlin big mom","charlotte linlin","big mom","linlin"]},{"label":"Charlotte Smoothie","acceptedKeys":["charlotte smoothie","smoothie"]},{"label":"Charlotte Cracker","acceptedKeys":["charlotte cracker","cracker"]},{"label":"Charlotte Perospero","acceptedKeys":["charlotte perospero","perospero"]},{"label":"Monkey D. Luffy","acceptedKeys":["monkey d luffy","luffy"]},{"label":"Shanks","acceptedKeys":["shanks"]},{"label":"Coby","acceptedKeys":["coby"]}]}],"hasNonRosterBranches":false,"parserStatus":"roster_only"},"partyConflictKeys":["katakuri & oven","katakuri","oven"],"characterTags":["Big Mom Pirates","Sweet 3 General","Paramythia-type"],"builderAbilities"