,{"Name":"Reduce Slot Bind duration","description":["Reduces Slot Bind duration by 10 turns on this character"]},{"Name":"Reduce Special Use Limit duration","description":["Reduces Special Use Limit duration by 3 turns"]}],"supportData":[{"supportedCharactersText":"Charlotte Linlin (Big Mom), Charlotte Cracker, Charlotte Smoothie, Charlotte Perospero","levelDescriptions":["Once per adventure, when the supported character uses their special, deals 50x character''s ATK in Typeless damage to all enemies at the end of the turn for 1 turn, and adds 0.6x to chain multiplier for 1 turn."]}],"swapData":null,"vsSpecial":null,"superType":null,"superTandemData":null,"finalTapData":null,"rushSugoSpecialData":null,"superClass":null,"rumbleData":{"id":4020,"ability":[{"effects":[{"attributes":["HP","ATK"],"effect":"buff","level":5,"targeting":{"targets":["[DEX]"]}},{"attributes":["DEF"],"effect":"buff","level":5,"targeting":{"targets":["Powerhouse"]}},{"attributes":["SPD"],"effect":"buff","level":2,"targeting":{"targets":["[DEX]"]},"condition":{"type":"character","team":"crew","families":["Charlotte Linlin (Big Mom)"]}}]}],"special":[{"cooldown":30,"effects":[{"amount":2000,"effect":"damage","range":{"direction":"sideways","size":"large"},"targeting":{"targets":["enemies"]},"type":"fixed"},{"attributes":["Accuracy"],"effect":"debuff","level":3,"range":{"direction":"sideways","size":"large"},"targeting":{"targets":["enemies"]}},{"amount":30,"attributes":["Special CT"],"effect":"hinderance","targeting":{"count":1,"priority":"highest","stat":"Special CT","targets":["enemies"]}}]}],"resilience":[{"attribute":"Special Bind","chance":100,"type":"debuff"},{"attribute":"[QCK]","percentage":30,"type":"damage"}],"gpability":[{"effects":[{"attributes":["SPD","HP"],"effect":"buff","level":3,"targeting":{"targets":["[DEX]","[INT]"]}},{"attributes":["Special CT"],"effect":"buff","level":2,"targeting":{"targets":["[DEX]","[INT]"]}},{"attributes":["HP","ATK"],"effect":"buff","level":6,"targeting