      VALUES (4237, '{"characterId":4237,"captainAbility":"Boosts ATK of [DEX] characters by 4x, boosts ATK of all other characters by 3.5x, boosts HP of all characters by 1.3x, deals 10% of enemies'' current HP in damage to all enemies at the end of each turn, and reduces Special Cooldown of this character by 1 turn after each turn you take damage. If HP is below 80% and a crew member uses a special, increases Special Counter of this character by 1 (effect can be activated again if HP goes above 80%). Recovers 50% of damage taken from enemies in the previous stage when entering a new stage. At the beginning of each Stage, increases the Attack Timer of all enemies by 1 turn.","captainAbilityVariants":[{"key":"captain","label":"Captain Ability","text":"Boosts ATK of [DEX] characters by 4x, boosts ATK of all other characters by 3.5x, boosts HP of all characters by 1.3x, deals 10% of enemies'' current HP in damage to all enemies at the end of each turn, and reduces Special Cooldown of this character by 1 turn after each turn you take damage. If HP is below 80% and a crew member uses a special, increases Special Counter of this character by 1 (effect can be activated again if HP goes above 80%). Recovers 50% of damage taken from enemies in the previous stage when entering a new stage. At the beginning of each Stage, increases the Attack Timer of all enemies by 1 turn."}],"captainNotes":"Special Counter counts the amount of times that the character''s special has been used in the adventure. Special Counter of this character maxes at 3.","specialName":"Strawman Cards: The Hierophant Reversed, The Card of Pursuit","specialText":"Deals 500x character''s ATK in Typeless damage to one enemy, changes orbs, including [BLOCK] orbs, of this and adjacent characters into Matching orbs, increases Chain Tap Timing Bonus of [DEX], Cerebral, and Slasher characters to +0.2x-0.6x for 3 turns depending on Tap Timing, adds 20x the damage taken from enemies before the special is activated a