come of Action Special.","specialNotes":". Advantageous Class Effect boosts damage against enemies with Class Weakness. Action Special: MISS: 2.5x, GOOD: 2.7x, GREAT: 2.8x, PERFECT: 2.9x, EXCELLENT: 3x","superSpecialText":"Changes all orbs, including [BLOCK] orbs, into [TND] orbs, recovers 8,000 HP at the end of the turn for 10 turns, increases boost effects of Base ATK buffs by 1.5x (up to 4,000), boosts Orb Effects of Cerebral and Fighter characters by 2x, allowing override, for 1 turn, transforms [INT] characters into Super [INT] characters, and transforms Cerebral characters into Super Cerebral characters.","superSpecialCriteriaText":"Can be launched as crewmate. When crew has used 8 specials or your crew must consist of any 2 of the following, excluding Supports and counting only 1 per unit: Monkey D. Luffy, Portgas D. Ace, Monkey D. Garp, Curly Dadan, Emporio Ivankov, Belo Betty, Morley, Karasu, Lindbergh, Koala, Hack, Inazuma, Bartholomew Kuma, Ginny, Monkey D. Dragon, Nico Robin","superSpecialNotes":null,"superSpecialCriteria":{"rawText":"Can be launched as crewmate. When crew has used 8 specials or your crew must consist of any 2 of the following, excluding Supports and counting only 1 per unit: Monkey D. Luffy, Portgas D. Ace, Monkey D. Garp, Curly Dadan, Emporio Ivankov, Belo Betty, Morley, Karasu, Lindbergh, Koala, Hack, Inazuma, Bartholomew Kuma, Ginny, Monkey D. Dragon, Nico Robin","requiresCaptain":false,"excludesSelf":false,"rosterBranches":[{"branchType":"character_count_any","requiredCount":2,"matchMode":"unique_options","options":[{"label":"Monkey D. Luffy","acceptedKeys":["monkey d luffy","luffy"]},{"label":"Portgas D. Ace","acceptedKeys":["portgas d ace","ace"]},{"label":"Monkey D. Garp","acceptedKeys":["monkey d garp","garp"]},{"label":"Curly Dadan","acceptedKeys":["curly dadan","dadan"]},{"label":"Emporio Ivankov","acceptedKeys":["emporio ivankov","ivankov"]},{"label":"Belo Betty","acceptedKeys":["belo betty","betty"]},{"label":"Morley","accep