w''s Percent Damage Reduction buff, for 3 turns. Then, boosts Crew Damage Reduction to ATK of Cerebral and Driven characters by 1x-2x, proportional to the strength of crew''s Percent Damage Reduction buff, for 1 turn.","specialNotes":null,"superSpecialText":"Reduces Special Bind duration by 7 turns on this character, boosts ATK against delayed enemies by 2.25x for 3 turns, and transforms [QCK] characters into Super [QCK] characters.","superSpecialCriteriaText":"Can be launched as crewmate. This character must have a [EMPTY] or [G] orb or your crew must consist of any 1 of the following, excluding supports and counting only 1 per unit: Vergo, Monet, Baby 5, Sugar, Giolla, Lao G., Senor Pink, Machvise, Dellinger, Gladius, Buffalo, Kaido, Caesar Clown (Gastino)","superSpecialNotes":null,"superSpecialCriteria":{"rawText":"Can be launched as crewmate. This character must have a [EMPTY] or [G] orb or your crew must consist of any 1 of the following, excluding supports and counting only 1 per unit: Vergo, Monet, Baby 5, Sugar, Giolla, Lao G., Senor Pink, Machvise, Dellinger, Gladius, Buffalo, Kaido, Caesar Clown (Gastino)","requiresCaptain":false,"excludesSelf":false,"rosterBranches":[{"branchType":"character_count_any","requiredCount":1,"matchMode":"unique_options","options":[{"label":"Vergo","acceptedKeys":["vergo"]},{"label":"Monet","acceptedKeys":["monet"]},{"label":"Baby 5","acceptedKeys":["baby 5"]},{"label":"Sugar","acceptedKeys":["sugar"]},{"label":"Giolla","acceptedKeys":["giolla"]},{"label":"Lao G.","acceptedKeys":["lao g"]},{"label":"Senor Pink","acceptedKeys":["senor pink","pink"]},{"label":"Machvise","acceptedKeys":["machvise"]},{"label":"Dellinger","acceptedKeys":["dellinger"]},{"label":"Gladius","acceptedKeys":["gladius"]},{"label":"Buffalo","acceptedKeys":["buffalo"]},{"label":"Kaido","acceptedKeys":["kaido"]},{"label":"Caesar Clown (Gastino)","acceptedKeys":["caesar clown gastino","caesar clown","gastino","clown"]}]}],"hasNonRosterBranches":true,"parserSta