w has 2+ [Red-Haired Pirates] characters, ignores Debuff Protection and delays all enemies by 1 turn, increases duration of any Percent Damage Reduction buffs by 2 turns, including effects activated in the same ability, and inflicts all enemies with Set Target, increasing damage taken from [STR], Cerebral and Shooter characters by 1.75x and reducing Special Cooldown of [STR], Cerebral and Shooter characters by 2 turns when they defeat an enemy, for 1 turn.","specialNotes":null,"superSpecialText":"Applies Territory: Cerebral to the field for 2 turns, deals 100x character''s ATK in Typeless damage to all enemies, boosts ATK against delayed enemies by 1.75x for 1 turn, and transforms Cerebral characters into Super Cerebral characters.","superSpecialCriteriaText":"Can be launched as crewmate. Your crew must consist of any 2 of the following, excluding supports and counting only 1 per unit: [Red-Haired Pirates] characters","superSpecialNotes":null,"superSpecialCriteria":{"rawText":"Can be launched as crewmate. Your crew must consist of any 2 of the following, excluding supports and counting only 1 per unit: [Red-Haired Pirates] characters","requiresCaptain":false,"excludesSelf":false,"rosterBranches":[{"branchType":"character_count_any","requiredCount":2,"matchMode":"any_candidate","options":[{"label":"[Red-Haired Pirates] characters","acceptedKeys":["red haired pirates","pirates"]}]}],"hasNonRosterBranches":false,"parserStatus":"roster_only"},"partyConflictKeys":["beckman & yasopp","beckman","yasopp"],"characterTags":["Red-Haired Pirates","Elbaph Arc"],"builderAbilities":[{"key":"remove_special_bind","label":"Remove Special Bind","minTurns":10,"isCompleteRemoval":false,"slotTokens":[],"source":"specialText","coverageMode":"explicit"},{"key":"boost_atk","label":"Boost ATK","minTurns":null,"isCompleteRemoval":false,"slotTokens":[],"source":"specialText","coverageMode":"explicit"},{"key":"reduce_damage","label":"Reduce Damage","minTurns":null,"isCompleteRemoval":false,"slo